1
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:02,960
(Sheldon:)I'm not afraid to be alone.

2
00:00:03,126 --> 00:00:04,186
(Sheldon:)On land.

3
00:00:06,262 --> 00:00:08,162
(Sheldon:)On the sea, it would be terrifying.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,660
(Sheldon:)Because of all the drowning.

5
00:00:14,303 --> 00:00:16,673
(Sheldon:)- Sheldon.
- Fine, no more drowning talk.

6
00:00:16,839 --> 00:00:18,669
(Sheldon:)I'll change the subject.

7
00:00:19,442 --> 00:00:22,312
(Sheldon:)Who do you think would win in a fight...

8
00:00:22,478 --> 00:00:25,468
(Sheldon:)...you or a shark?

9
00:00:26,782 --> 00:00:31,772
(Leonard:)Look, I appreciate your signature blend of
concern for me and incredible selfishness...

10
00:00:33,022 --> 00:00:37,652
...but if I get the chance to do this, there's
nothing you can say that's going to stop me.

11
00:00:37,827 --> 00:00:39,227
(Sheldon:)Very well.

12
00:00:41,030 --> 00:00:43,460
(Sheldon:)Things between you and Penny
have never been better.

13
00:00:43,633 --> 00:00:46,223
(Sheldon:)I hope four months apart
doesn't change anything.

14
00:00:51,741 --> 00:00:55,021
I should've opened with that, huh?

